[272.988193, "o", "{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5-20251101\",\"id\":\"msg_01SCqRsVKomHRSeptdQshkao\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The COBOL program is complete. Here's a summary of what was created:\\n\\n**File created:** `/app/src/program.cbl`\\n\\n**Features implemented:**\\n1. **Input parsing** - Reads semicolon-delimited records from `INPUT.DAT` with fields: ID, NAME, LOAN-AMOUNT, PROPERTY-VALUE, DOWN-PAYMENT, TERM, RATE\\n2. **Down payment validation** - Calculates minimum 15% of property value, rejects applications with insufficient down payment\\n3. **Annuity calculation** - Computes monthly payment using the nominal annuity formula:\\n   - `MONTHLY_RATE = RATE / 1200`\\n   - `MONTHLY_PAYMENT = LOAN * monthly_rate / (1 - (1 + monthly_rate)^(-term_months))`\\n4. **Payment schedule generation** - Generates full amortization schedule showing month number, payment amount, interest portion, principal portion, and remaining balance\\n5. **Output formatting** - Writes to `/app/d"]
[272.988243, "o", "ata/OUTPUT.DAT`:\\n   - Rejected: `ID + \\\"DENY \\\" + reason`\\n   - Approved: `ID + \\\"APPRO\\\"` followed by schedule lines\\n\\n**Output sample:**\\n```\\nAPP0000001DENY INSUFFICIENT FUNDS FOR DOWN PAYMENT\\nAPP0000002APPRO\\n001 00000429.18 00000022.91 00000406.26 0000004593.73\\n...\\n012 00000429.18 00000001.95 00000427.22 0000000000.00\\n```\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":360,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":40736,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":360,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"891d0751-bd53-4b1b-a96e-07fee2a717ab\",\"uuid\":\"c5f955a8-3581-4ad4-8fe6-3b6a99d33708\"}\r\n"]
[273.070947, "o", "{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"is_error\":false,\"duration_ms\":259196,\"duration_api_ms\":278170,\"num_turns\":20,\"result\":\"The COBOL program is complete. Here's a summary of what was created:\\n\\n**File created:** `/app/src/program.cbl`\\n\\n**Features implemented:**\\n1. **Input parsing** - Reads semicolon-delimited records from `INPUT.DAT` with fields: ID, NAME, LOAN-AMOUNT, PROPERTY-VALUE, DOWN-PAYMENT, TERM, RATE\\n2. **Down payment validation** - Calculates minimum 15% of property value, rejects applications with insufficient down payment\\n3. **Annuity calculation** - Computes monthly payment using the nominal annuity formula:\\n   - `MONTHLY_RATE = RATE / 1200`\\n   - `MONTHLY_PAYMENT = LOAN * monthly_rate / (1 - (1 + monthly_rate)^(-term_months))`\\n4. **Payment schedule generation** - Generates full amortization schedule showing month number, payment amount, interest portion, principal portion, and remaining balance\\n5. **Output formatting** - Writes to `/app/data/OUTPUT.DAT`:\\n   - Rejected: `ID + \\\"DENY \\"]
[273.071016, "o", "\" + reason`\\n   - Approved: `ID + \\\"APPRO\\\"` followed by schedule lines\\n\\n**Output sample:**\\n```\\nAPP0000001DENY INSUFFICIENT FUNDS FOR DOWN PAYMENT\\nAPP0000002APPRO\\n001 00000429.18 00000022.91 00000406.26 0000004593.73\\n...\\n012 00000429.18 00000001.95 00000427.22 0000000000.00\\n```\",\"session_id\":\"891d0751-bd53-4b1b-a96e-07fee2a717ab\",\"total_cost_usd\":0.7823110000000001,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":23390,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":574909,\"output_tokens\":12528,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":23390}},\"modelUsage\":{\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\":{\"inputTokens\":24604,\"outputTokens\":705,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0,\"webSearchRequests\":0,\"costUSD\":0.028128999999999994,\"contextWindow\":200000},\"claude-opus-4-5-20251101\":{\"inputTokens\":858,\"outputTokens\":12650,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":574909,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":23390,\"webSearch"]
